# Cloudflare Pages _headers — offline hardening (2026-10-27).
#
# Why: the CDN default for static assets is `max-age=0, must-revalidate`.
# `must-revalidate` means the browser HTTP cache may NOT serve a stale copy,
# so when the device is offline the SHELL files (document, sw.js, engines)
# become un-fetchable — and iOS Safari refuses to even route an offline
# navigation through the service worker for a fresh tab, showing its
# "cannot open page" error instead.
#
# Fix: keep online behaviour instant (max-age=0 => revalidate every load,
# updates land immediately) while allowing the HTTP cache to serve its
# stale copy when the revalidation fails (offline) — stale-if-error (RFC
#5861). Once the document loads, the service worker (v7) takes over and
# serves everything else from its cache.
#
# Deliberately NOT listed: /wasm/pikafish.nnue* — the Cloudflare function
# sets its own policy (v7: max-age=0 + stale-while-revalidate +
# stale-iferror, so online requests always revalidate but the browser HTTP
# cache can serve the stale 50MB offline); the .part files keep the default
# must-revalidate so a new engine deploy reassembles fresh bytes.

/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, stale-while-revalidate=604800, stale-if-error=31536000
/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, stale-while-revalidate=604800, stale-if-error=31536000
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, stale-while-revalidate=604800, stale-if-error=31536000
/engine.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, stale-while-revalidate=604800, stale-if-error=31536000
/engine-wasm.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, stale-while-revalidate=604800, stale-if-error=31536000
/manifest.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, stale-while-revalidate=604800, stale-if-error=31536000
/icons/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, stale-while-revalidate=604800, stale-if-error=31536000
/wasm/pikafish-single.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, stale-while-revalidate=604800, stale-if-error=31536000
/wasm/pikafish-single.wasm
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, stale-while-revalidate=604800, stale-if-error=31536000
